{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"也想起上回【没敢开口】\",\"source\":\"他想起上回明明想告诉对方却没有开口。\",\"type\":5,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只说想告诉对方却没有开口，没有说明是因为不敢，屏幕稿增加了害怕、不敢的动机。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"想到两人能【互相依靠】\",\"source\":\"想到两个人也许能互相依靠\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿对两人能否互相依靠保留了猜测，屏幕稿删去“也许”，变成了确定判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"要是哪天对方【不再需要他】，连相处都不自在呢？\",\"source\":\"要是哪天对方不再需要他陪，连和他待着都不自在了呢？\",\"type\":8,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿具体担心的是对方不再需要他陪伴，屏幕稿扩大成对方不再需要他，丢失了陪伴这一具体含义。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"像重回旧房子，家具没变，知道得越多越心疼\",\"source\":\"家具可能没变，可你知道的事情已经太多了。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿对家具是否改变保留了可能性，屏幕稿将其写成确定事实。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d006aac9-60c4-4d0e-ab01-22471e1c0f24", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T165258343437Z", "elapsed_seconds": 286.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T16:57:44.797905+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "26cd00e69629d59fa8604059a61bb8f15b123e1e7bd45641f471e6e6f62c1ab5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "co